@startuml Data Flow Waterfall
!theme plain
title <font size=20><b>Data Flow Waterfall: Request to Response Timeline</b></font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

skinparam participant {
    BorderColor #000000
    BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFACD
    BorderColor #000000
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    LifeLineBorderColor #333333
    GroupBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
}

participant "Browser\n(JavaScript)" as Browser #BBDEFB
participant "StripeOrder\nController" as Controller #C8E6C9
participant "Event\nDispatcher" as Dispatcher #FFF9C4
participant "Contract\nCreationHandler" as ContractHandler #FFE0B2
participant "Checkout\nSessionHandler" as SessionHandler #FFCC80
participant "Contract\nRepository" as Repository #E1BEE7
participant "Stripe\nAPI" as Stripe #FFCDD2
database "MySQL\nDatabase" as DB #F8BBD0

== PHASE 1: Create Checkout Session (HTTP POST) ==

Browser -> Controller: POST /index.php?cl=order&fnc=createCheckoutSession
activate Controller #C8E6C9

note over Controller
  **Request Headers:**
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

  **Session Data Available:**
  - sess_basket (serialized Basket)
  - sess_user (User object)
  - usr (user ID)
end note

Controller -> Controller: Validate request
Controller -> Controller: Create EventContext

note right of Controller #FFFACD
  **EventContext:**
  {
    basket: Basket,
    user: User,
    userId: "abc123",
    sessionId: "sid_xxx",
    shopId: 1,
    shopUrl: "https://shop.de/",
    conditionTypes: ["payment_authorized"]
  }
end note

Controller -> Dispatcher: dispatch(StripeCheckoutSessionRequestEvent)
activate Dispatcher #FFF9C4

Dispatcher -> ContractHandler: handle(event) [priority: 100]
activate ContractHandler #FFE0B2

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: Create BasketSnapshot from Basket

note right of ContractHandler #FFFACD
  **BasketSnapshot:**
  {
    items: [{title: "Product 1", unitPrice: 29.99, quantity: 2}],
    total: 59.98,
    currency: "EUR",
    shippingCost: 4.99
  }
end note

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: Create PaymentContract (DRAFT)
ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: Add ContractCondition(payment_authorized)
ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: Extract delivery_address_hash from session

note right of ContractHandler #FFE0B2
  **Contract Metadata:**
  {
    delivery_address_hash: "e09dae058fb2...",
    delivery_address_id: "addr_456"
  }
end note

ContractHandler -> Repository: save(contract)
activate Repository #E1BEE7
Repository -> DB: INSERT INTO osc_stripe_contracts\n(id, user_id, state, basket_snapshot, metadata, ...)
DB --> Repository: OK
Repository --> ContractHandler: contract (with ID)
deactivate Repository

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: context.setContract(contract)
ContractHandler --> Dispatcher: done
deactivate ContractHandler

Dispatcher -> SessionHandler: handle(event) [priority: 0]
activate SessionHandler #FFCC80

SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: contract = context.getContract()
SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: buildLineItems(basketSnapshot)

note right of SessionHandler #FFFACD
  **Stripe Line Items:**
  [
    {
      "price_data": {
        "currency": "eur",
        "unit_amount": 2999,
        "product_data": {"name": "Product 1"}
      },
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
end note

SessionHandler -> Stripe: POST /v1/checkout/sessions
activate Stripe #FFCDD2

note right of Stripe #FFCDD2
  **Request Body:**
  {
    "mode": "payment",
    "line_items": [...],
    "success_url": "https://shop.de/...",
    "cancel_url": "https://shop.de/...",
    "metadata": {
      "contract_id": "contract_789",
      "shop_id": "1"
    }
  }
end note

Stripe --> SessionHandler: CheckoutSession {id: "cs_xxx", url: "https://checkout.stripe.com/..."}
deactivate Stripe

SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: contract.setProvider('stripe', sessionId, successUrl)
SessionHandler -> Repository: save(contract)
activate Repository #E1BEE7
Repository -> DB: UPDATE osc_stripe_contracts SET provider_name, provider_order_id
DB --> Repository: OK
deactivate Repository

SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: context.set('checkoutSessionId', id)
SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: context.set('checkoutUrl', url)
SessionHandler --> Dispatcher: done
deactivate SessionHandler

Dispatcher --> Controller: event processed
deactivate Dispatcher

Controller -> Controller: Store in PHP session:\n- stripe_checkout_session_id\n- stripe_contract_id

Controller --> Browser: JSON Response
deactivate Controller

note right of Browser #BBDEFB
  **Response:**
  {
    "id": "cs_xxx",
    "url": "https://checkout.stripe.com/...",
    "contract_id": "contract_789"
  }
end note

Browser -> Browser: window.location.href = response.url

== PHASE 2: Customer on Stripe Checkout ==

Browser -> Stripe: Redirect to Stripe Checkout
activate Stripe #FFCDD2
Stripe -> Stripe: Customer enters payment details
Stripe -> Stripe: Process payment
Stripe --> Browser: Redirect to success_url
deactivate Stripe

== PHASE 3: Return from Stripe (HTTP GET) ==

Browser -> Controller: GET /index.php?cl=order&fnc=checkoutSuccess&session_id=cs_xxx
activate Controller #C8E6C9

Controller -> Dispatcher: dispatch(StripeCheckoutReturnEvent)
activate Dispatcher #FFF9C4

note over Dispatcher
  **Event carries:**
  - checkoutSessionId: "cs_xxx"
  - context (empty initially)
end note

Dispatcher -> SessionHandler: StripeCheckoutReturnHandler.handle(event)
activate SessionHandler #FFCC80

SessionHandler -> Stripe: GET /v1/checkout/sessions/cs_xxx?expand[]=payment_intent
activate Stripe #FFCDD2

Stripe --> SessionHandler: CheckoutSession {payment_status: "paid", metadata: {...}}
deactivate Stripe

note right of SessionHandler #FFFACD
  **Retrieved Data:**
  {
    "id": "cs_xxx",
    "payment_status": "paid",
    "amount_total": 6497,
    "currency": "eur",
    "metadata": {
      "contract_id": "contract_789"
    },
    "payment_intent": {
      "id": "pi_yyy"
    }
  }
end note

SessionHandler -> Repository: findById("contract_789")
activate Repository #E1BEE7
Repository -> DB: SELECT * FROM osc_stripe_contracts WHERE id = "contract_789"
DB --> Repository: contract data (with metadata!)
Repository --> SessionHandler: PaymentContract
deactivate Repository

SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: **restoreDeliveryAddressHash()**

note right of SessionHandler #C8E6C9
  **CRITICAL:**
  $hash = contract.getMetadata('delivery_address_hash');
  session.setVariable('sDelAddrMD5', $hash);
  // Now OXID Order::validateDeliveryAddress() will pass!
end note

SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: context.setContract(contract)
SessionHandler -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PaymentAuthorizedEvent)

note over Dispatcher #E1BEE7
  **PaymentAuthorizedEvent:**
  - authorizationId: "pi_yyy"
  - providerOrderId: "cs_xxx"
  - amount: 64.97
  - currency: "eur"
end note

Dispatcher -> ContractHandler: PaymentAuthorizedEventHandler.handle()
activate ContractHandler #FFE0B2

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: contract.transitionToPending()
ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: contract.fulfillCondition('payment_authorized')

note right of ContractHandler #C8E6C9
  **State Transitions:**
  DRAFT -> PENDING -> READY_TO_COMMIT
  (auto-transition when all conditions fulfilled)
end note

ContractHandler -> Repository: save(contract)
activate Repository #E1BEE7
Repository -> DB: UPDATE state, conditions
DB --> Repository: OK
deactivate Repository

ContractHandler -> Dispatcher: dispatch(ContractReadyToCommitEvent)

Dispatcher -> ContractHandler: StripeOrderCreationHandler.handle()
activate ContractHandler #FFE0B2

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: ShopOrderService.createOrder()

note right of ContractHandler #C8E6C9
  **Order Creation:**
  1. Get basket from session
  2. Call Order::finalizeOrder()
  3. **validateDeliveryAddress() passes**
     because sDelAddrMD5 was restored!
  4. Create order in oxorder table
end note

ContractHandler -> DB: INSERT INTO oxorder
DB --> ContractHandler: orderId

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: contract.commitToOrder(orderId)
ContractHandler -> Repository: save(contract)
activate Repository #E1BEE7
Repository -> DB: UPDATE order_id, state = COMMITTED
DB --> Repository: OK
deactivate Repository

ContractHandler -> ContractHandler: context.set('orderId', orderId)
ContractHandler --> Dispatcher: done
deactivate ContractHandler

deactivate ContractHandler

SessionHandler -> SessionHandler: context.set('redirectTarget', 'thankyou')
SessionHandler --> Dispatcher: done
deactivate SessionHandler

Dispatcher --> Controller: event processed
deactivate Dispatcher

Controller -> Controller: session.sess_challenge = orderId
Controller -> Controller: clearStripeSessionVariables()
Controller --> Browser: Redirect to 'thankyou'
deactivate Controller

== PHASE 4: Thank You Page ==

Browser -> Browser: Display order confirmation

legend right
    |= Color |= Layer |
    | <#BBDEFB> | Browser |
    | <#C8E6C9> | Controller |
    | <#FFF9C4> | Dispatcher |
    | <#FFE0B2> | Handlers |
    | <#E1BEE7> | Repository |
    | <#FFCDD2> | Stripe API |
    | <#F8BBD0> | Database |
endlegend

@enduml
